    "name":  "Fixed Waterproof Circular Ring - CURVED EFFECT - GU10-MR16 - IP65 - BLACK",
    "reference":  "91816",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover the resilience and performance of your lights with our \u003cstrong\u003eFixed Watertight Circular Ring GU10-MR16\u003c/strong\u003e. This ring, certified \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e, provides complete protection against moisture and dust, ensuring reliable operation in any environment. Its\u003cstrong\u003e translucent lens\u003c/strong\u003e not only adds an aesthetic touch but also eliminates glare, offering soft and enveloping illumination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnsure durability and enhance the aesthetics of your spaces with this high-quality watertight ring.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eFixed Watertight Circular Housing GU10-MR16 - IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the perfect combination of durability and performance with our \u003cstrong\u003eFixed Watertight Circular Ring GU10-MR16\u003c/strong\u003e, a lighting solution designed to stand out in any environment. Certified with \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e, this ring not only provides complete protection against moisture and dust but also ensures reliable and long-lasting operation, even in challenging conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP65 Certification for Complete Protection:\u003c/strong\u003e The IP65 rating ensures that this ring is completely watertight to moisture and dust, allowing you to install it in a variety of environments without worrying about premature wear.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTranslucent Lens for Perfect Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e Equipped with a translucent lens, this ring not only adds an aesthetic touch to your lighting but also eliminates glare, providing soft and enveloping illumination. Enjoy bright environments without visual discomfort.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDurable and Aesthetic Design:\u003c/strong\u003e The ring is designed with high-quality materials that guarantee durability and resistance. Its polished aesthetics enhance the appearance of any space, making it an elegant and functional addition.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Performance in Any Environment:\u003c/strong\u003e Whether indoors or outdoors, this fixed watertight circular ring is designed to face environmental challenges. From living rooms to industrial environments, it provides constant and reliable lighting.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Installation and Minimal Maintenance:\u003c/strong\u003e Its intuitive design makes installation easy, saving time and effort. Moreover, maintenance is minimal, ensuring optimal performance over time.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Applications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLiving Rooms and Gathering Areas\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutdoors and Gardens\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCommercial Spaces\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndustrial Environments\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffices and Work Areas\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnsure Durability and Enhance Aesthetics:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis Fixed Watertight Circular Ring GU10-MR16 is not just a high-resistance lighting solution but also an aesthetic statement. Elevate the lighting experience in your spaces, offering a perfect combination of functionality and style. Discover how lighting excellence can transform your environments with this high-quality watertight ring.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
